<item>
            <title>[LU-20784] sanity test_154C: Delete is not completed in 83 seconds</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20784</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;sanity test_154C failed on el8.10 ldiskfs DNE in its cleanup stack_trap, not&lt;br/&gt;
in the fid2path lookup it tests.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Failure message:&lt;br/&gt;
  Delete is not completed in 83 seconds&lt;br/&gt;
  test_154C returned 1&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Both fid2path lookups had already returned the expected path:&lt;br/&gt;
  ost_fid=0x30000040b:0x3f2:0x0 with outpath=/mnt/lustre/f154C.sanity&lt;br/&gt;
  ost_fid=0x34000040b:0x1f1:0x0 with outpath=/mnt/lustre/f154C.sanity&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;The test then runs stack_trap &quot;rm -rf $tf; wait_delete_completed&quot;.&lt;br/&gt;
wait_delete_completed_mds() polled osc.&lt;b&gt;MDT&lt;/b&gt;.sync_* for 83 seconds and gave&lt;br/&gt;
up with one osc still syncing:&lt;br/&gt;
  osc.lustre-OST0007-osc-MDT0000.sync_in_progress=1&lt;br/&gt;
Every other osc had sync_changes=0 and sync_in_flight=0. No crash, LBUG or&lt;br/&gt;
Lustre error appeared on any node console during the test.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Test session: &lt;a href=&quot;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sessions/54deafed-c3a0-49b8-9762-1109f4dd5524&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sessions/54deafed-c3a0-49b8-9762-1109f4dd5524&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
Test set: &lt;a href=&quot;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/3f7e81a0-01b8-4fcf-a484-ec3c2adbc063&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sets/3f7e81a0-01b8-4fcf-a484-ec3c2adbc063&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
clients and servers: &lt;a href=&quot;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/131931&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://build.whamcloud.com/job/lustre-reviews/131931&lt;/a&gt; - el8.10 x86_64&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Evidence that this is not caused by the change under test (review 68763,&lt;br/&gt;
&quot;&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20724&quot; title=&quot;tests: fsx burst mode and client cache drop option&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;LU-20724&quot;&gt;LU-20724&lt;/a&gt; tests: add fsx burst mode for multiple mounts&quot;):&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul class=&quot;alternate&quot; type=&quot;square&quot;&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The change touches only lustre/tests/fsx.c and lustre/tests/sanityn.sh.&lt;br/&gt;
  Every new fsx.c code path is gated on the new &quot;-I burst&quot; policy; sanity&apos;s&lt;br/&gt;
  only fsx call (test_150id) passes a single path and the default policy,&lt;br/&gt;
  and test_154C does not use fsx at all.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;The same build passed the same test group, sanity included, on el9.8&lt;br/&gt;
  (&lt;a href=&quot;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sessions/c589e8f3-bb4e-4b85-8ba0-26bad779984c&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sessions/c589e8f3-bb4e-4b85-8ba0-26bad779984c&lt;/a&gt;)&lt;br/&gt;
  and on aarch64&lt;br/&gt;
  (&lt;a href=&quot;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sessions/9ec09283-3b8f-4bc8-b13c-76371668dcf8&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://testing.whamcloud.com/test_sessions/9ec09283-3b8f-4bc8-b13c-76371668dcf8&lt;/a&gt;).&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;sanity test_154C was run 10 times on a 2 MDT / 4 OST ldiskfs DNE VM with&lt;br/&gt;
  this change built and mounted: 10/10 PASS.&lt;/li&gt;
	&lt;li&gt;Maloo test history for test_154C on lustre-reviews over the last 60 days:&lt;br/&gt;
  32 PASS, 1 FAIL, the failure being this one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;


&lt;p&gt;A wait_delete_completed timeout is a known failure mode on other subtests &amp;#8211;&lt;br/&gt;
&lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-17106&quot; title=&quot;sanity test_59: Delete is not completed in 28 seconds&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;LU-17106&quot;&gt;LU-17106&lt;/a&gt; (sanity test_59), &lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-19785&quot; title=&quot;sanity:  &apos;test_24A returned 1&apos; - Delete is not completed in 81 seconds&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;LU-19785&quot;&gt;LU-19785&lt;/a&gt; (sanity test_24A), &lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-15386&quot; title=&quot;sanity test_150bb: Delete is not completed in 40 seconds&quot; class=&quot;issue-link&quot; data-issue-key=&quot;LU-15386&quot;&gt;LU-15386&lt;/a&gt; (sanity&lt;br/&gt;
test_150bb) &amp;#8211; but no ticket covers test_154C.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Raised by Patch Watcher run pw-engineer-68763-ps4-f07affee209f on &lt;a href=&quot;https://review.whamcloud.com/68763&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow noopener&quot;&gt;https://review.whamcloud.com/68763&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</description>
